@startuml activity
' CampusSwap — Activity diagram: life of a swap request
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFF0F2
  BorderColor #FF385C
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7EB
  DiamondBorderColor #FFA114
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  TitleFontStyle bold
}

|Student|
start
:Log in with Thapar email;
repeat
  :Browse rooms in eligible hostels;
  :Rank up to 5 rooms and submit;
  |System|
repeat while (Request valid?) is (no: show the reason)
->yes;
:Save request as **open**\nand give a tracking ID;
repeat
  |Warden|
  :Run TTC matching round;
  |System|
  :Each student points at the owner\nof their best available room;
  :Closed loops become swap chains;
repeat while (Student in a chain?) is (no: stay in the pool)
->yes;
:Mark request **matched**;\nstart 48-hour deadline;
|Student|
:Review the swap chain;
if (Everyone confirms before the deadline?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Cycle **confirmed**;
  |Warden|
  :Approve the swap;
  |System|
  :Move each student to their new seat;\nrequests **completed**;
  stop
else (someone declines / deadline passes)
  |System|
  :Cycle **dissolved**;
  :Decliners and non-answerers: **withdrawn**\nEveryone else: back to **open**;
  stop
endif
@enduml
